#chapter(
  title: "Introduction to Complex Systems and Computational Modeling",
  abstract: [
    This chapter defines complex systems, computational models of dynamical systems, and the knowledge-driven modeling approach used throughout the book. It contrasts top-down mathematical models with bottom-up individual-based models and explains why formal, executable models are needed for analysis and prediction.
  ],
